    apply: "Write out the five accounts of the commission side by side and underline the common elements. Identify your Jerusalem, Judea, Samaria and ends of the earth and pray for each. Take one step to reach one of those circles. Memorise Matthew 28:19-20.",
    activity: "Divide learners into groups to study one commission passage each and report. Create a combined chart of elements. Draw four concentric circles and place people and places in each. Pray.",
