    apply: "Write down your top three excuses for not sharing your faith and read Matthew 28:18-20 over each one. Pray for courage and for an opportunity this week. Ask a friend to pray for you. Memorise Matthew 28:20.",
    activity: "Read Matthew 28:18-20 and Acts 18:9-11. Make a list of fears and answer each with a promise from Scripture. Share an experience of God's help in speaking about faith. Pray for each other.",
